{"id":"07ae859069ffbf99","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFmRow.md","title":"FFmRow","display":"FFmRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FFmRow","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","z1232","z1233","z1234"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FFmRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>z1232</span><span>z1233</span><span>z1234</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>z1232</code>、<code>z1233</code>、<code>z1234</code>。</p>\n<p>一阶公式；E=0 禁用对象语言等号，E=1 使用真相等。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FFmRow E F R f r z1232 z1233 z1234)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z1234 t)\n    (and\n      (@ FSig E F R f r)\n      (or\n        (exists z1237\n          (exists z1238\n            (exists z1239\n              (and\n                (in z1237 R)\n                (and\n                  (@ App r z1237 z1239)\n                  (and\n                    (@ FRel z1237 z1238 t)\n                    (and\n                      (@ Seq z1238 z1239)\n                      (forall z1240\n                        (implies (in z1240 z1239) (exists z1241 (and (@ App z1238 z1240 z1241) (@ FTerm F f z1241))))))))))))\n        (or\n          (exists z1242\n            (exists z1243\n              (and (@ Num1 E) (and (@ FEq z1242 z1243 t) (and (@ FTerm F f z1242) (@ FTerm F f z1243))))))\n          (or\n            (exists z1242\n              (and\n                (@ PNeg z1242 t)\n                (exists z1245 (exists z1246 (and (in z1245 z1233) (and (@ App z1232 z1245 z1246) (= z1246 z1242)))))))\n            (or\n              (exists z1242\n                (exists z1243\n                  (and\n                    (@ PImp z1242 z1243 t)\n                    (and\n                      (exists z1247 (exists z1248 (and (in z1247 z1233) (and (@ App z1232 z1247 z1248) (= z1248 z1242)))))\n                      (exists z1249 (exists z1250 (and (in z1249 z1233) (and (@ App z1232 z1249 z1250) (= z1250 z1243)))))))))\n              (exists z1244\n                (exists z1242\n                  (and\n                    (@ Nat z1244)\n                    (and\n                      (@ FAll z1244 z1242 t)\n                      (exists z1251 (exists z1252 (and (in z1251 z1233) (and (@ App z1232 z1251 z1252) (= z1252 z1242))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" href=\"?note=f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" title=\"ZFC_FEq\">FEq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"372f265dbb09b97a\" href=\"?note=372f265dbb09b97a\" title=\"ZFC_FRel\">FRel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"50085369706c1ec8\" href=\"?note=50085369706c1ec8\" title=\"ZFC_FSig\">FSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"21487f65c94a2183\" href=\"?note=21487f65c94a2183\" title=\"ZFC_FTerm\">FTerm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FFmRow E F R f r z1232 z1233 z1234)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FSig|FSig]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FAll","status":"resolved","id":"b01633bdf3140514","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]；[[ZFC_FSig|FSig]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FEq","status":"resolved","id":"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FAll|FAll]]；[[ZFC_FEq|FEq]]；[[ZFC_FRel|FRel]]